<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial">Dear <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">&lt;Client Contact&gt;</span>,</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">I hope you’re well.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[If pre renewal]</span> I’d like to schedule time to review an Executive Service Summary with you in advance of your renewal with Insperity. This report provides a high-level overview of the projects, services plans, and general services you and your employees have engaged in and benefitted from during your last year with Insperity. It can assist as a roadmap in demonstrating the value of your relationship with Insperity and provide an outline of and direction for your future goals.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[If post renewal]</span> Thank you so much for your renewal and reinvestment in the Insperity® relationship. I look forward to our continued partnership and would like to schedule time with you to discuss your business’s future goals. In this meeting we will review an Executive Service Summary, a report that report provides a high-level overview of the projects, services plans, and general services you and your employees have engaged in and benefitted from during your last year with Insperity. It can assist as a roadmap in demonstrating the value of your relationship with Insperity and provide an outline of and direction for your future goals.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Let me know if either of the times below will work for you or provide an alternative suggestion. I will send a calendar invitation under separate email once confirmed.&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Wednesday, December 9th at 10:30 a.m.&nbsp; CT</span>&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Friday, December 11th at 3 p.m. CT&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Thank you for trusting Insperity to serve your business. I look forward to meeting with you.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[signature]</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>